<title>USA: Brush sees Q4 sales up vs Q3.</title>
<headline>Brush sees Q4 sales up vs Q3.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brush Wellman Inc said on Monday that order patterns suggest that fourth quarter sales will improve compared with the third quarter.</p>
<p>Earnings are also expected to increase, the company said.</p>
<p>Longer term, it appears capacity constraints and product mix shifts may limit the potential for growth until the new capacity comes on stream in 1998, it added.</p>
</text>
